  "notes": "さあ is a versatile interjection.\n\nUSAGES:\n1. Encouragement: さあ、{頑張|がんば}って！(Come on, do your best!)\n2. Uncertainty: 「いつ？」「さあ...」(\"When?\" \"Well...\")\n3. Starting something: さあ、{食|た}べよう (Now, let's eat)\n\nSIMILAR:\n- じゃあ (well then - transitional)\n- では (well then - more formal)",
